    <string name="about_developed_by">Developed by: The Geniuses of Quantum Chaos and Musical Developments S.A.S.</string>
    <string name="about_description_part1">Tonika is the revolutionary app that lets you feel music in your bones (chicken bones, that is). Tired of traditional harmony? So are we! That\'s why we created Tonika, where dissonance is an art and rhythm is a suggestion.</string>
    <string name="about_features">Key Features:\n🎵 Invisible notes: Challenge your auditory perception.\n🥁 Random rhythms: No two songs are ever the same (not even the same song twice).\n🤯 \'Chaos\' Mode: Because sometimes you just want to watch the world burn (musically).</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Patents pending in the Andromeda galaxy. We are not responsible for inexplicable catchy melodies or the sudden urge to cha-cha in public.</string>
